---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design Tonopah AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="Septic system design, percolation testing and ADEQ permits in Tonopah, AZ. Fast 3-5 day turnaround. Hablamos español. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-tonopah-arizona"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in Tonopah, AZ</h1>
      <p>ADEQ-certified septic design, percolation testing and permits for Tonopah and western Maricopa County. Fast turnaround, bilingual service.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>
    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic Services in Tonopah and Western Maricopa County</h2>
      <p>Tonopah and the surrounding areas of western Maricopa County are largely rural — most properties here are not connected to municipal sewer systems. Whether you're building a new home, adding a structure, or buying a property in Tonopah, you will need a properly designed and permitted septic system before construction can begin.</p>

      <h2>Services We Provide in Tonopah, AZ</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site and soil evaluations</li>
        <li>Percolation testing (perc tests)</li>
        <li>ADEQ-approved septic system design</li>
        <li>Maricopa County permit submission</li>
        <li>Seepage pit performance testing</li>
        <li>Septic system inspections</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Diaz Environmental for Tonopah Properties</h2>
      <p>We are familiar with the soil and terrain conditions of western Maricopa County, including the caliche and rocky conditions common in the Tonopah area. We own our own excavation equipment — no waiting on subcontractors — which is how we deliver results in 3–5 business days.</p>

      <h2>Servicios Sépticos en Tonopah, AZ</h2>
      <p>Diaz Environmental ofrece diseño de sistemas sépticos aprobados por ADEQ, pruebas de percolación y permisos en Tonopah y el oeste del Condado de Maricopa. Somos bilingües y contamos con equipo propio para los tiempos de respuesta más rápidos del área. ¡Contáctanos hoy!</p>
    </section>
    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving Tonopah, Buckeye, Goodyear & Western Maricopa County</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> for a free same-day consultation.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>